# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/

# IDE / VCS
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Secrets MUST NOT be baked into the image.
# appsettings.Development.json holds live credentials and is loaded only when
# ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development; the container injects all secrets via env vars
# at deploy time instead. Keep it out of the build context entirely.
**/appsettings.Development.json

# Misc
**/*.user
**/.env
**/*.md
**/TestResults/
